              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esangweni legceke makube khona isilenge esiyizingalo ezingamashumi amabili, okuyindwangu eluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka nokubomvu nokubomvu, nelineni elicolekileyo lemicu ephothiweyo, umsebenzi womfekethiso; izinsika zawo zibe zine, nezinyawo zazo zibe zine.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.16"
            ]
