        {
          "text": "Ubude begceke bube yizingalo eziyikhulu, ububanzi bube yizingalo ezingamashumi ayisihlanu yonke indawo, ukuphakama kube yizingalo eziyisihlanu zelineni elicolekileyo elisontiwe, izisekelo zazo zibe yithusi.",
